  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Disaster Vermin — Innate Technique (18th level)</em></p><p><em>Domain Expansion (rules): full-turn action, 20 CE unless stated, 175-ft radius, 1 minute. When the domain ends you suffer <strong>Technique Burnout</strong> (applied automatically by the module).</em></p><p>Finally at 18th level you have learned to expand your domain. At initiative 20, up to 3 creatures of your choice within your domain take 6d10 necrotic damage as eggs fester and burst from their skin. <br />\n A creature that dies within your domain is devoured and becomes an Insect Swarm. This Insect Swarm does not count against your maximum number of controlled swarms until the domain ends.</p>",
